		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Red warhorse coated in a glistening bloody sheen.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 73, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 hooves +8 (2d8) or apocalypse breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 15</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Apocalypse Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from horse. DEX 15+ or 2d4 DEX damage and stunned 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver weapons or magic sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Unyielding to Oblivion</strong>. Cannot be destroyed within far of the Horseman of War.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
